    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a desktop pet?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back in ancient times, there was a type of computer software that showed a little character moving around your desktop. They were entertainingly annoying and very popular. This project aims to create a modern take on that genre by incorporating a touch of contemporary game logic into the characters, along with good visuals and physics-powered interactivity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features in the full release</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue and dating sim. mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More complex behaviors </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More interaction options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More customization options</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a desktop pet?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back in ancient times, there was a type of computer software that showed a little character moving around your desktop. They were entertainingly annoying and very popular. This project aims to create a modern take on that genre by incorporating a touch of contemporary game logic into the characters, along with good visuals and physics-powered interactivity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features in the full release</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue and dating sim. mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More complex behaviors </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More interaction options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More customization options</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mix of a shimeji and a tamagotchi, but it's actually a tiny customizable waifu living in your desktop. Browse the internet, write a document or play a game. It doesn't matter, you'll never be able to concentrate with its constant nagging for care.",
